// Menu showroom: a night-time garage corner (rc_render showroom/). Its spots, neon strips and
// LED ring are part of the set (showroom/diorama.rs); this file sets the camera look, the
// moonlight through the side-wall window (the key light) and the room's image-based lighting.
// Every time of day looks the same.
